WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.918 --> 00:00:07.174
♪♪

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:09.218
Detective Parsa:
There are no secrets in 
the city of New York.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.763
Detective Parsa:
There’s cameras everywhere,
phone records, parking tickets.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:17.017
Detective Parsa:
Someone saw something, 
heard something.

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:18.227
(Gun shot)

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:19.686
Detective Parsa:
The city always knows.

00:00:21.605 --> 00:00:23.440
Sam got shot in Central Park.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:25.317
Help!

00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:28.570
♪♪

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:29.988
Charlie:
We’re like basically 
best friends.

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:32.199
♪♪

00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:33.659
Detective Parsa:
We’re going to find 
who did this to her. 

00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:39.706
When we figure out who the
connection to Samantha is, we
figure out who shot her.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:48.423
♪♪

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:50.384
Regan:
Two police detectives were here.

00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:53.220
Regan:
Where were you on July 4th?

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.847
♪♪

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:57.683
William:
I don’t know how, 
I don’t know why,

00:00:58.684 --> 00:01:00.644
but this girl is 
connected to us.

00:01:00.644 --> 00:01:02.104
♪♪

00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:03.063
Charlie:
You guys know Sam?

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:05.107
You might know why she 
left me and got shot?

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:05.857
♪♪

00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:06.733
Nicky:
Sam was one of us.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:07.150
(Camera click)

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:09.569
Whatever Sam knew, 
I want to know too.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:11.989
♪♪

00:01:11.989 --> 00:01:13.282
Man:
She left me clues.

00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:14.533
Man:
She was onto something.

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:16.994
William:
I think I’m the only one 
that can figure this out.

00:01:17.411 --> 00:01:18.829
Detective Parsa:
We gotta learn more 
about these people.

00:01:18.829 --> 00:01:21.123
♪♪

00:01:21.123 --> 00:01:22.541
Detective McFadden:
Money for generations.

00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:23.542
Detective McFadden:
They’re hiding something.

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:26.169
♪♪

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:28.338
Nicky:
When we started this revolution,

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:29.798
we knew it would have a cost.

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:33.260
♪♪

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:34.219
Please!

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:35.595
♪♪

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.639
Man:
You’re not the only 
one with secrets.

00:01:37.639 --> 00:01:46.315
♪♪

